      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I'll write the improved test. The key improvements are:\n1. Remove all unused imports, constants, and helper methods (dead code)\n2. Add inline comments explaining what each sub-test is encoding (which character/byte)\n3. Group related assertions to make the intent clearerThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused imports, constants, and helper methods (dead code from the original class), and adds inline comments that explain the byte values of `\"hello world\"` and the intent of each assertion group, making the test significantly easier to understand at a glance."
